lieve in as well I made a video  about marketing being about values and  the same thing applies to your team if  you are very clear and what  your business stands for and who you're  trying to help and in what you believe  in as a company these are the things  that we believe in that are core to us  that we will not accept things going  wrong on then if you can attract people  who believe the same things they're  going to stay with your business they're  not going to leave on you if you need a  programmer for your company you don't  just need somebody who has programming  skills there's tons of those people you  don't just need somebody who you can get  along with you need somebody who  believes the same thing that you believe  in and my business is all about helping  entrepreneurs I love helping  entrepreneurs I help entrepreneurs even  I'm not getting paid to help  entrepreneurs I make these videos  because I love helping entrepreneurs  even though there's no payday at the end  of a lot of the stuff I do I do it  because I love it and everybody on my  team loves helping entrepreneurs my  programmer ADIZ he loves helping  entrepreneurs he's a program he's got  great skills he's built all the code  behind my website but he also loves  helping entrepreneurs and that's why  he's stuck with me for years you want to  bring on the people who would do their  job even if they weren't getting paid  for now I'm not suggesting you don't pay  your staff but you want the people who  love with so much ideally you are doing  your business because you love it right  if you're not quit go find something  else you have to love your business and  you would do it even if you weren't  getting paid you take on part-time jobs  just to make ends meet so you can keep  building what you're building the people  you bring on have to have that same  feeling don't settle on bringing  somebody on just because they have the  skills you're looking for but they don't  have the belief in what you're doing it  all starts with you getting clear on  what you're all about what is your  company stand for what do you trying to  accomplish and making that explicitly  clear to everybody who you're dealing  with everybody who you try to bring on  they have to know what you stand for and  you have to get the same excitement and  feeling from them about that mission  most entrepreneurs don't have a mission  they don't have a vision they don't have  anything that they staying for  if you don't have something that you  stand for that you believe in  passionately then it's no wonder people  are leaving you because you weren't  clear in the first place over who you  wanted to hire and everybody makes this  mistake so you know if you've gone  through that don't feel bad this is your  opportunity now to change things around  clearly define what you stand for what  you believe in make sure it resonates  with you here in your heart to your core  like this is what you do and then  everybody that you bring on board has to  feel the same way about that belief they  have to have the skills that you need  and they have to have the values that  you have once you get that you've picked  a winning employee who will stay with  you for the long term and will pour  their heart into your business not just  do what you ask them to do not just do  it because you're looking over their  shoulder you're giving them tight  deadlines they do it because they love  to do it they do it because they want to  do it if those are the kind of people  you need to go after and it starts with  you getting clear on what you stand for  believe for those are you watching you  like the video please give it a thumbs  up below it makes you want to do more  for you and I want to hear you have to  think every morning i turn on my  computer I eat my breakfast and I look  at the comments that come in so please  leave a comment to say if you liked it  or not and if you have a question for  your own business I'd love to